# Joint R62/R63 RAM payload component

Accepted R63 objects are relinked into the qualified R61 SRAM layout. There are no
math, worker or SDK source compiles. All79 SDK/worker objects are reused exactly;
the bench object changes only5 pinned literal words in main. All186 other worker
functions and all instruction opcodes remain exact. The blobs object changes only
embedded math data. Main math208456B has424B free, hot3988B has108B free, data16B,
Qfplib6364B in its8KiB region. Worker/core0 stack/core1/first4KiB boundaries remain
fixed. BIN257940B, entry0x20001001, VTOR0x20001100, SP0x20041000. No Flash writer.

The new finite matrix has84pairs/252states: all36 R63 targets, all6 R62 targets,
all24 previous physical pairs including all8 slow controls, all16 selected legal
helper controls and exact half/sticky/decline neighbors across word branches.
1008 fresh public RAM calls plus one actual-ROM math loader pass against pinned
gold. All42 target pairs are faster than correct Qfplib by instruction count.
Four other pairs remain slower. All306 wrong-Qfplib outcomes and their costs are
retained. This is not a physical-cycle or universal accuracy claim.

Actual CRT runs2779 instructions to runtime_init; first4KiB/core1 bank unchanged.
Full SDK startup and148 earlier worker primitive calls are inherited through
byteexact function proofs, not replayed or counted fresh. Actual RAM guard66words
and original120prefix semantics/callee targets match accepted R63.

Four finite proposed batches cover each state exactly once. First smoke is
24pairs/72states,78queries,2940calls including calibration. Total276queries,
10320targetcalls for the proposed round. Each batch has a new distinct nonce,
2warmups+8samples/library, all3SIO/all3Qfplib plus R63; the protocol is unchanged.
No old30 R61 batches resume. Fresh exact Root grant/reload is required per batch.

This seals only the payload component. Refreshed capture/operators/return plan
and whole-packet Root review are still required before any hardware action.
Device/canonical/Git/Flash/SD/RTC-setter authority remains false. Full original
math goal, universal CR/termination/stack/FMA/integration remain open.
